/**
 * Salasel Cloud — Contabo provisioning module for WHMCS (custom, white-label).
 *
 * Auto-creates a Contabo compute instance (VPS/VDS) when an order is activated,
 * and lets the client manage it (start / stop / restart) from the WHMCS client
 * area. The word "Contabo" is never shown to the customer.
 *
 * ── Credentials (Setup ▸ Products/Services ▸ Servers ▸ add a server) ──
 *   Username    = Contabo API User (the email under Account Secret)
 *   Password    = Contabo API Password (Account Secret)
 *   Access Hash = <OAuth2 client_id>|<OAuth2 client_secret>   (pipe-separated)
 *   Hostname    = api.contabo.com   (informational)
 *
 * ── Per-product Module Settings (config options) ──
 *   Product ID  = Contabo productId (e.g. V45)   ← required
 *   Region      = EU / US-central / US-east / US-west / SIN
 *   Image ID    = OS image UUID (blank = Contabo default Ubuntu)
 *   Period      = 1 / 3 / 6 / 12 (months)
 *   SSH Key     = optional Contabo secretId of an SSH key
 *
 * Salasel Babel IT — salaselbabel.com
 */

